              <li><strong>Named Meat First Ingredient:</strong> The first ingredient must be real poultry, ocean fish, or dehydrated salmon, not vague grain by-products or cereal fillers.</li>
              <li><strong>Controlled Ash &amp; Magnesium Content (&lt;0.1%):</strong> Crucial in Pakistan to safeguard male cats from Feline Lower Urinary Tract Disease (FLUTD) and urethral stone blockages.</li>
              <li><strong>Digestibility &amp; Stool Quality:</strong> High-grade proteins produce small, firm, odorless stools rather than voluminous loose feces.</li>
            </ol>
